    <details key="rulesetVersion" value="&lt;structValue>&#xA;&lt;name>CrossBorderFraudDetectionOperation&lt;/name>&#xA;&lt;uuid>c8065506-d5f8-49d9-9b07-14cff80ea43e&lt;/uuid>&#xA;&lt;documentation>Decision Service Operation for Cross-Border Transaction Fraud Detection.&#xA;Accepts a Transaction object containing merchant country, customer KYC profile, compliance flags,&#xA;and velocity metrics. Returns the transaction with fraud decision (APPROVE/REVIEW/BLOCK),&#xA;risk score, triggered rules, decision reason code, and recommended action.&#xA;&#xA;REST Endpoint: POST /DecisionService/rest/v1/CrossBorderFraudDetection_Ruleset/execute&#xA;Input: JSON Transaction payload&#xA;Output: JSON Transaction with fraudDecision, riskScore, decisionReasonCode, recommendedAction, auditMessages&lt;/documentation>&#xA;&lt;/structValue>"/>
